  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Masterplan Beira (EKN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands embassy in Maputo, Mozambique contributes co financing to the Partners for Water programme in the framework of the delta cooperation activities in Mozambique.The delta cooperation&apos;s objective is: increase resilience in the face of water security risk.Major needs are:&#x2022; hard and soft delta infrastructure,&#x2022; improved access to drinking water and sanitation services,&#x2022; improved maritime infrastructure and embedded water management improvement in broader urban management improvement in coastal cities.The DC in Mozambique applies the operational policy framework: strengthening implementation capacity in partner deltas and strengthening bilateral relations in the water sector.</narrative>
  </description>
